{"ticker":"KMB","updated":"2026-11-07T00:30:03Z","profile":{"longName":"Kimberly-Clark Corporation","shortName":"Kimberly-Clark Corporation","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Household & Personal Products","country":"United States","website":"https://www.kimberly-clark.com","fullTimeEmployees":36000,"marketCap":66536972288,"trailingPE":20.692749,"forwardPE":14.922149,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.016478,"pegRatio":2.28,"targetMeanPrice":114.625,"targetHighPrice":162.0,"targetLowPrice":90.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.004,"earningsGrowth":3.007,"grossMargins":0.37305,"operatingMargins":0.13182999,"profitMargins":0.19931999,"totalRevenue":16565999616,"beta":0.276,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":116.82,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":92.42,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.64},"summary":"Kimberly-Clark Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and markets personal care products in the United States. It operates in two segments, North America and International Personal Care. The North America segment offers disposable diapers, training and youth pants, swimpants, baby wipes, feminine and incontinence care products, reusable underwear, facial and bathroom tissue, paper towels, napkins, wipers, tissue, towels, soaps and sanitizers, and other related products under the Huggies, Pull-Ups, Goodnites, Kotex, Poise, Depend, Kleenex, Scott, Cottonelle, Viva, Wypall, and other brand names. Its International Personal Care segment provides baby and child care, adult care and feminine care, including disposable diapers, training and youth pants, swimpants, baby wipes, feminine and incontinence care products, reusable underwear, and other related products under the Huggies, Kotex, Goodfeel, Intimus, Depend, and other brand names. The company sells its household use products directly to supermarkets, mass merchandisers, drugstores, warehouse clubs, variety and department stores, and other retail outlets, as well as through other distributors and e-commerce. It also sells its professional use products through distributors directly to manufacturing, lodging, office building, food service, and high-volume public facilities, as well as through e-commerce. Kimberly","summary_zh":"金佰利公司及其子公司在美國生產和銷售個人護理產品。它的業務分為兩個部分：北美部分和國際個人護理部分。北美部門提供一次性尿布、訓練褲和青少年褲、游泳褲、嬰兒濕紙巾、女性和失禁護理產品、可重複使用的內衣、面巾紙和浴室紙巾、紙巾、餐巾紙、擦拭布、紙巾、毛巾、肥皂和消毒劑以及其他相關產品，包括 Huggies、Pull-Ups、GoodWypco、cocoal、cococoal、coex、cxle、Kexle、Kaltton、Kex其國際個人護理部門提供嬰兒和兒童護理、成人護理和女性護理，包括一次性尿布、訓練和青少年褲、游泳褲、嬰兒濕紙巾、女性和失禁護理產品、可重複使用內衣以及 Huggies、Kotex、Goodfeel、Intimus、Depend 和其他品牌的其他相關產品。該公司將其家用產品直接銷售給超市、量販店、藥局、倉儲俱樂部、雜貨店和百貨公司以及其他零售店，以及透過其他經銷商和電子商務。它還透過分銷商直接向製造、住宿、辦公大樓、食品服務和大容量公共設施以及電子商務銷售其專業用途產品。金伯利","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"居家及個人產品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":129.24,"h":130.13,"l":127.77,"c":129.78,"v":2916800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":129.95,"h":131.53,"l":129.39,"c":130.97,"v":2325500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":130.24,"h":130.83,"l":127.01,"c":128.01,"v":2279100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":128.25,"h":130.02,"l":127.87,"c":129.47,"v":1745000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":128.9,"h":129.87,"l":127.95,"c":127.99,"v":1442300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":127.42,"h":127.78,"l":125.05,"c":125.47,"v":3077600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":125.4,"h":126.06,"l":124.48,"c":125.04,"v":2084500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":125.32,"h":126.98,"l":125.32,"c":125.59,"v":2304400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":124.72,"h":126.42,"l":124.38,"c":125.51,"v":1821900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":126.12,"h":126.55,"l":124.24,"c":124.62,"v":6928100},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":124.43,"h":125.13,"l":123.8,"c":124.07,"v":2683800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":124.12,"h":124.43,"l":122.58,"c":123.82,"v":2452100},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":123.15,"h":124.55,"l":123.01,"c":123.93,"v":1459900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":124.32,"h":124.5,"l":121.02,"c":121.72,"v":4024700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":121.82,"h":122.91,"l":121.49,"c":122.23,"v":2292600},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":122.59,"h":122.82,"l":121.37,"c":122.66,"v":2851200},{"t":"2025-09